  "body": "E2E message sending has been incredibly slow over the last few weeks on Matrix.org - this looks to be due to to_device messages taking disproportionately long relative to normal messages - e.g. 10-20s to send to_device versus 2-3s to send normal messages.  For instance, here are the timings of me (see last column for durations) trying to send to_device messages last time I was investigating this:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1038\" alt=\"Screenshot 2020-03-24 at 17 14 57\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1294269/78249245-f1209a80-74e5-11ea-9b5e-0c8fe3bbe293.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nIt's not just me seeing this:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"856\" alt=\"Screenshot 2020-04-02 at 13 27 46\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1294269/78249149-c7677380-74e5-11ea-9481-373bcd38c9c1.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n",
